.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">entrust oneself, leave one's case to,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τινί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.96</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διαιτητῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.95</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.5.8</span> </span>; also, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to entrust what is one's own to</b> another, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.155</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">157</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">6</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be entrusted,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ᾧ λαοί τ' ἐπιτετράφαται</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pl.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> for <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιτετραμμένοι εἰσί</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.25</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῇς</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">Ὥραις</span>) <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιτέτραπται μέγας οὐρανός</span> heaven's gate <b class=\"lex-tr\">is committed to</b> them (to open and to shut), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.750</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.142</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑπό τινων ἐπιτρεφθῆναι</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ἰατρῷ</span>), of a patient, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3.5</span> </span>: c. acc. rei, <